    * `:deny_null_bind` (boolean) — Denies an unauthenticated LDAP bind request if the user's password is empty; defaults to true Defaults to `true`.
    * `:dereference_aliases` (string) — When aliases should be dereferenced on search operations. Accepted values are 'never', 'finding', 'searching', 'always'. Defaults to 'never'. Defaults to `"never"`.
